codex
All required files now exist, with the oracle transcripts explicitly marked as error-only evidence. I also found and fixed a parameter-bound edge case: the original default could request more distinct affine near-rules than exist at the smallest size and loop forever. The generator now rejects impossible parameter combinations immediately and its default works at the hand-scale minimum.
exec
